    "body": "fix on mkinney:issue/2396-sim-stock-visible · PR #2446 · pinned by stock_play_precalc::the_picture_at_the_start_is_the_uncut_stock_after_the_calculation · merges when reviewed. Cause: #2181 packed the playback worker's GPU base (PackedBase, whose eikonal pass bakes max(mesh, cut) into the mesh layer) after the calculation before playback, i.e. from the finished stock - every frame drew the finished part, hidden inside the model.",
